{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">MINE THE WORLD is a new mining spin-off game by Brilliantcrypto, premium partner of Paris Saint-Germain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It's an easy-to-pick up, hard-to-put down game focused on the action of mining.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Be sure to add it to your wishlist \u2014 you\u2019ll get a notification when it\u2019s released!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game takes you on an adventure across a variety of regions inspired by the real-world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From frozen mountains and arid deserts to mysterious jungles and the iconic cityscape of Paris, each location offers unique ores, environmental challenges, and secrets to uncover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With only your trusty pickaxe in hand, you'll travel the world in search of treasure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover the thrill of discovery and excavation in MINE THE WORLD's global mining adventure.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3718380?t=1749174193","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718380/637c68c7b16ecb0ea689bd42228cb2f2d37db104/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749174193","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718380/c26fa3f750a4a1f602ef0e92dc0e09f1fffd8bc7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749174193","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718380/c26fa3f750a4a1f602ef0e92dc0e09f1fffd8bc7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749174193","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">MINE THE WORLD is a new mining spin-off game by Brilliantcrypto, premium partner of Paris Saint-Germain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It's an easy-to-pick up, hard-to-put down game focused on the action of mining.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Be sure to add it to your wishlist \u2014 you\u2019ll get a notification when it\u2019s released!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game takes you on an adventure across a variety of regions inspired by the real-world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From frozen mountains and arid deserts to mysterious jungles and the iconic cityscape of Paris, each location offers unique ores, environmental challenges, and secrets to uncover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With only your trusty pickaxe in hand, you'll travel the world in search of treasure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover the thrill of discovery and excavation in MINE THE WORLD's global mining adventure.</p>","developers":["Brilliantcrypto, Inc."],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718380/f9dfc7a63d99291fd66aec10819497cff2250f7f/header.jpg?t=1749174193","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 11 Big Sur<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> HD Graphics 630 or higher</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257146365,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257146365/movie480.mp4?t=1748342353","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257146365/movie_max.mp4?t=1748342353"},"name":"MINE THE WORLD_Movie","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257146365/56f78f0b7dd11eeb157454c5b3b36a64fe40e21e/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1748342353","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257146365/movie480_vp9.